      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a lot of info, thanks. what about the more \"hidden\" or less obvious stuff? like, were there any legends or even superstitions that traveled along with these goods? i was reading that some people thought certain travelers or even the goods themselves carried weird omens or stories. was there any kind of \"folklore\" or mythical stuff that moved between the cultures as they interacted?",
